  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Reducing trade costs for SMEs through better management of NTM&#x2019;s, especially SPS standards, and implementation of the TFA Agreement 
- Leveraging action and funding for Aid for Trade through innovative projects and effective coordination with governments, donors and the private sector.

